WEBVTT

00:00.450 --> 00:05.180
<i>It's the National Middle School Football Tournament final match, between Nankatsu MS and Toho Academy,</i>

00:05.180 --> 00:07.680
<i>and the match has returned to square one!</i>

00:08.670 --> 00:10.140
<i>It's my responsibility...</i>

00:12.570 --> 00:14.230
<i>I couldn't even made a call on defense,</i>

00:14.230 --> 00:17.150
<i>and let them assist Tsubasa in the goal!</i>

00:17.150 --> 00:19.780
That goal was on me!

00:21.360 --> 00:25.700
I will take it myself, and pay them back with my Tiger Shot!

00:25.700 --> 00:26.460
Damn!

00:26.460 --> 00:27.200
Stop him!

00:28.790 --> 00:30.500
<i>Izawa is unable to stop him!</i>

00:30.500 --> 00:31.600
<i>I will make it!</i>

00:31.600 --> 00:34.040
<i>I won't let you get in my way!</i>

00:34.040 --> 00:35.500
I'll stop him!

00:37.860 --> 00:40.300
<i>This time, Hyuga is the one blown away!</i>

00:42.880 --> 00:45.390
<i>That's a foul call against Takasugi.</i>

00:45.390 --> 00:47.140
Damn you, one more step and...

00:48.530 --> 00:52.640
One more step and I would've shot the ball, and you deliberately fouled me!

00:52.640 --> 00:53.710
What?!

00:53.710 --> 00:54.400
Get off of me!

00:54.400 --> 00:55.420
Why, you...

00:55.420 --> 00:56.400
Captain!

00:56.400 --> 00:57.650
Stop it!

00:57.650 --> 01:01.320
<i>Tempers are flaring after that physical play!</i>

01:01.320 --> 01:02.650
<i>That's not good.</i>

01:04.220 --> 01:07.330
<i>It looks like a card will be shown.</i>

01:07.330 --> 01:10.570
<i>If it's a red card, the player would be ejected immediately...!</i>

01:14.210 --> 01:16.920
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

01:14.210 --> 01:16.920
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

01:17.840 --> 01:20.510
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

01:17.840 --> 01:20.510
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

01:21.420 --> 01:24.130
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

01:21.420 --> 01:24.130
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

01:31.020 --> 01:33.850
<i>moeru you ni hitori demo</i>

01:31.020 --> 01:33.850
<i>I kept running, lying to myself</i>

01:33.850 --> 01:40.110
<i>ikiteyukeru to usobuite hashiritsudzuketa</i>

01:33.850 --> 01:40.110
<i>that I could live alone, though the loneliness made me burn</i>

01:40.110 --> 01:45.990
<i>unubore no morosa wo kimi wa shitte ita no ni</i>

01:40.110 --> 01:45.990
<i>You knew how fragile my self-conceit makes me</i>

01:45.990 --> 01:52.580
<i>kokoro made uchinomesareta kono yoru ni</i>

01:45.990 --> 01:52.580
<i>In this night that even shattered my heart</i>

01:52.580 --> 01:56.580
<i>kimi no koe sagasu</i>

01:52.580 --> 01:56.580
<i>I hate how weak I am</i>

01:56.580 --> 02:01.090
<i>kono yowasa ga nikui yo</i>

01:56.580 --> 02:01.090
<i>yearning for your voice</i>

02:01.090 --> 02:06.680
<i>ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya</i>

02:01.090 --> 02:06.680
<i>"I've got to get you back right now!"</i>

02:06.680 --> 02:08.220
<i>baka darou?</i>

02:06.680 --> 02:08.220
<i>I'm stupid, right?</i>

02:08.220 --> 02:09.430
<i>ai</i>

02:08.220 --> 02:09.430
<i>Love!</i>

02:09.430 --> 02:12.930
<i>kizudarake no ai wo shinjite</i>

02:09.430 --> 02:12.930
<i>Believing in my scarred love</i>

02:12.930 --> 02:22.820
<i>nagareochita namida sae mo tsuyosa e to kaete</i>

02:12.930 --> 02:22.820
<i>I will turn these shedded tears into strength</i>

02:22.820 --> 02:23.650
<i>ai</i>

02:22.820 --> 02:23.650
<i>Love!</i>

02:23.650 --> 02:27.450
<i>kizudarake no ai da to shite mo</i>

02:23.650 --> 02:27.450
<i>Even though it is a scarred love</i>

02:27.450 --> 02:31.450
<i>bokura no sekai wo tomoshiteru</i>

02:27.450 --> 02:31.450
<i>it lightens up our world</i>

02:31.450 --> 02:37.710
<i>kono ai mou ichibyou taritomo</i>

02:31.450 --> 02:37.710
<i>I will not let go of this love</i>

02:37.710 --> 02:40.540
<i>hanasanai</i>

02:37.710 --> 02:40.540
<i>for a single second!</i>

02:42.250 --> 02:47.260
<b><b>EPISODE 50:
A TENACIOUS ALL-OUT WAR</b></b>

02:47.380 --> 02:50.220
<i>It's a yellow card!</i>

02:50.220 --> 02:53.970
<i>A warning for both Hyuga and Takasugi, who were both getting physical!</i>

02:53.970 --> 02:55.650
A yellow card...

02:55.650 --> 02:57.730
Another one will mean a send-off.

02:57.730 --> 03:01.730
I can understand your excitement, but this is a football match.

03:01.730 --> 03:04.930
You two should avoid that kind of display.

03:04.930 --> 03:05.940
Yeah.

03:05.940 --> 03:07.130
Sorry.

03:07.950 --> 03:09.420
Sorry about that.

03:09.420 --> 03:10.910
Oh, sure.

03:13.490 --> 03:16.920
It's not your fault we're tied.

03:16.920 --> 03:20.750
If someone should bear the responsibility, it's all of us.

03:20.750 --> 03:23.350
You don't need to feel responsible, Hyuga.

03:23.350 --> 03:24.800
We're all a team, here.

03:25.220 --> 03:26.460
Takeshi.

03:26.460 --> 03:31.630
But still, you stayed true to your feelings and attacked Nankatsu all by yourself...

03:31.630 --> 03:35.410
We were happy to see that side of you is still there, Hyuga.

03:36.770 --> 03:38.130
Guys...

03:38.760 --> 03:39.990
It's a bad habit of mine.

03:39.990 --> 03:41.400
I flare up so quickly.

03:42.470 --> 03:49.800
Right. Let's get our fourth goal with Toho Academy's combined strength, and take back the lead!

03:49.800 --> 03:50.660
Yes, sir!

03:53.610 --> 03:54.910
<i>I'm so glad.</i>

03:54.910 --> 04:00.370
<i>I'm truly glad that I was able to play football with them all this time.</i>

04:00.920 --> 04:05.380
<i>It appears that Hyuga will take the free-kick and resume the game.</i>

04:05.380 --> 04:08.090
<i>Will he try for the goal directly?</i>

04:08.090 --> 04:10.520
Listen up! Don't even think about avoiding this!

04:10.520 --> 04:11.470
We know.

04:15.000 --> 04:16.900
<i>It's not a shot!</i>

04:16.900 --> 04:19.350
<i>It's a pass to Toho's leading scorer, Sorimachi!</i>

04:23.560 --> 04:24.310
Damn!

04:24.820 --> 04:25.980
Nice one, Tsubasa!

04:25.980 --> 04:27.150
Morisaki!

04:28.110 --> 04:30.280
All right! Let's counter! For Tsubasa's sake too!

04:31.360 --> 04:34.620
<i>If Wakashimazu's left arm really is hurt,</i>

04:34.620 --> 04:36.990
<i>then the right corner of the goal is his weakness!</i>

04:36.990 --> 04:39.410
<i>Let me try you once more!</i>

04:40.410 --> 04:41.210
Damn!

04:42.170 --> 04:44.980
<i>It was went a bit off and out on the right side.</i>

04:44.980 --> 04:46.480
There is no doubt.

04:46.480 --> 04:51.060
Yeah, even though you shot at the right corner, he tried to save it with his right hand.

04:51.590 --> 04:54.790
It looks like they've noticed Wakashimazu's hurt.

04:54.790 --> 04:55.430
What?

04:55.430 --> 05:00.760
Toho have held on this far thanks to Wakashimazu.

05:00.760 --> 05:04.480
Listen to me, guys! We'll help with Wakashimazu's share of defending now, too!

05:06.250 --> 05:08.650
<i>It's Toho's turn on offense, now!</i>

05:08.650 --> 05:10.810
Good! Go and get them, Toho!

05:13.110 --> 05:14.520
<i>Hyuga.</i>

05:14.520 --> 05:15.360
<i>Tsubasa.</i>

05:15.910 --> 05:19.090
<i>Despite how hurt you are, your eyes are still alive.</i>

05:19.090 --> 05:21.750
<i>As long as your eyes are that way, I won't have any mercy!</i>

05:21.750 --> 05:23.620
<i>I will fight you with all of my might!</i>

05:25.260 --> 05:29.170
<i>Tsubasa reflexively sticks his leg for the ball, but he's blown away!</i>

05:29.170 --> 05:29.920
Damn!

05:30.670 --> 05:31.630
Sorimachi!

05:31.630 --> 05:32.130
Captain!

05:32.130 --> 05:35.420
<i>A beautiful one-two pass between Hyuga and Sorimachi.</i>

05:35.420 --> 05:36.840
Hyuga is using team play again!

05:37.890 --> 05:38.850
<i>Great!</i>

05:40.040 --> 05:40.810
Stop it!

05:40.810 --> 05:42.220
The Tiger Shot flies straight!

05:42.220 --> 05:45.600
It may have a ton of power, but if we get in its way, we can stop it!

05:45.600 --> 05:53.360
Eat this! The Tiger Shot I created solely to defeat you, Nankatsu!

05:54.370 --> 05:58.870
<i>Hyuga's Tiger Shot scatters the three defenders jumped bravely in front of him!</i>

05:59.950 --> 06:01.620
<i>But he's caught it!</i>

06:01.620 --> 06:02.540
What?!

06:03.030 --> 06:07.940
<i>This is a diving catch from Morisaki on a weakened Tiger Shot by that blockage!</i>

06:04.290 --> 06:05.510
Good one!

06:05.510 --> 06:07.040
That's why Nankatsu were the champs!

06:07.940 --> 06:09.540
Nice catch, Morisaki!

06:09.540 --> 06:12.800
They stopped my Tiger Shot...

06:13.650 --> 06:14.770
Morisaki!

06:15.700 --> 06:16.920
Send it!

06:16.920 --> 06:18.050
Tsubasa!

06:18.050 --> 06:19.760
Okay, take it!

06:20.850 --> 06:22.690
<i>Tsubasa has the ball now!</i>

06:22.690 --> 06:24.300
<i>A counter-attack from Nankatsu!</i>

06:24.300 --> 06:24.980
This is bad!

06:24.980 --> 06:25.690
Fall back!

06:25.690 --> 06:30.360
<i>Just as Hyuga has the Tiger Shot, I have the Drive Shot.</i>

06:32.160 --> 06:34.210
<i>But... this doesn't feel right.</i>

06:34.210 --> 06:36.340
<i>My shoulder is burning hot,</i>

06:36.340 --> 06:41.280
<i>and my left leg's been numb for a while now.</i>

06:41.280 --> 06:42.280
Tsubasa!

06:42.850 --> 06:44.540
<i>Nevertheless, I need to shoot!</i>

06:45.110 --> 06:46.790
<i>I need to shoot!</i>

06:46.790 --> 06:50.250
<i>Is Tsubasa going for his Drive Shot here?!</i>

06:51.250 --> 06:53.630
<i>Sawada cuts the ball!</i>

06:53.630 --> 06:54.590
Tsubasa.

07:00.750 --> 07:01.800
<i>Tsubasa...</i>

07:03.180 --> 07:05.810
<i>Those frightening eyes...</i>

07:05.810 --> 07:08.530
<i>His gaze is even sharper than Hyuga's.</i>

07:08.530 --> 07:11.810
<i>Are those the eyes of a true warrior?</i>

07:13.580 --> 07:14.860
<i>The score is still tied!</i>

07:15.410 --> 07:17.400
<i>I won't stop until I score another goal!</i>

07:17.400 --> 07:19.280
That's our captain here!

07:19.280 --> 07:20.970
Okay guys, let's support Tsubasa!

07:20.970 --> 07:22.030
Attack!

07:22.030 --> 07:23.160
Guys!

07:23.160 --> 07:23.660
Take it!

07:24.100 --> 07:25.810
<i>Nankatsu switches to attack now!</i>

07:25.810 --> 07:27.660
<i>There are 14 minutes left in the match!</i>

07:27.660 --> 07:28.720
Go!

07:28.720 --> 07:30.620
Wakashimazu's left arm is injured!

07:30.620 --> 07:32.420
Exploit that weakness!

07:32.420 --> 07:33.840
Damn...

07:33.840 --> 07:36.700
Let's show them the true extent of Toho's defensive strength!

07:36.700 --> 07:38.300
We won't let you score a fourth!

07:40.050 --> 07:42.930
<i>When we can't keep moving forward, even if we're close to the goal,</i>

07:42.930 --> 07:45.810
<i>we always send the ball back once.</i>

07:45.810 --> 07:50.020
<i>Yeah, Nankatsu's game plan is always to send it back to our playmaker, Tsubasa.</i>

07:50.020 --> 07:52.650
<i>We know you are injured right now.</i>

07:52.650 --> 07:54.730
<i>Even so, we will send the ball to you.</i>

07:55.530 --> 07:59.280
<i>Toho strengthened their defense in front of the goal, leaving Tsubasa unmarked!</i>

07:59.280 --> 08:00.280
What?!

08:00.280 --> 08:01.160
Oh no!

08:01.160 --> 08:02.510
<i>It's time for the Drive Shot!</i>

08:02.510 --> 08:05.490
<i>If I aim for the right corner now, I can score for sure!</i>

08:05.490 --> 08:08.290
<i>Tsubasa gathers his strength in preparation for this shot!</i>

08:08.870 --> 08:11.290
<i>Can he paint the rainbow of victory?</i>

08:11.290 --> 08:13.070
Come if you will, Tsubasa!

08:13.070 --> 08:14.790
I will stop it with my right hand alone!

08:16.600 --> 08:18.940
Tiger Shot!

08:18.940 --> 08:21.130
<i>He blows in like a gust of wind from the side!</i>

08:23.180 --> 08:25.510
<i>He fires the ball away before it was shot!</i>

08:25.510 --> 08:29.270
<i>Hyuga defeated the Drive Shot with his Tiger Shot!</i>

08:29.270 --> 08:32.270
I won't give up the fourth goal, no matter what happens!

08:33.780 --> 08:34.980
Hyuga...

08:34.980 --> 08:38.290
<i>The stadium is left speechless by the spectacle of this grand battle!</i>

08:38.290 --> 08:41.860
<i>13 minutes remain in this fateful final match!</i>

08:49.990 --> 08:52.990
<i>The match resumes with Nankatsu's throw-in.</i>

08:52.990 --> 08:54.740
We won't lose!

08:54.740 --> 08:56.830
Yeah, we can't lose!

08:56.830 --> 08:57.670
Here!

08:59.960 --> 09:01.560
It's time for a counter-attack!

09:01.560 --> 09:03.500
Yeah, we can't lose!

09:03.500 --> 09:07.800
<i>Did Hyuga's play inspire this pack of tigers' fighting spirit?</i>

09:10.190 --> 09:12.420
<i>The ball successfully reaches Sorimachi!</i>

09:12.420 --> 09:14.490
<i>He has a chance to shoot!</i>

09:14.490 --> 09:16.810
<i>However, Sorimachi doesn't take the shot!</i>

09:16.810 --> 09:18.690
Shoot it please, Captain!

09:20.060 --> 09:23.820
He is right! That's why you've returned to the pitch, captain!

09:23.820 --> 09:29.160
It's your job to score the final winning goal that leads Toho Academy to victory, Hyuga!

09:29.160 --> 09:30.360
<i>Guys...</i>

09:31.200 --> 09:34.450
<i>The ball goes to the unmarked Hyuga in front of the goal!</i>

09:34.450 --> 09:36.080
Go for it, Kojiro!

09:36.580 --> 09:38.340
<i>I'll score it, guys!</i>

09:38.340 --> 09:40.920
<i>It is Hyuga's Tiger Shot!</i>

09:41.580 --> 09:42.840
Good, we got it!

09:45.090 --> 09:45.890
<i>I will stop him.</i>

09:45.890 --> 09:47.880
<i>I am the only one who can stop that!</i>

09:47.880 --> 09:48.800
Too reckless!

09:48.800 --> 09:51.720
If he takes Hyuga's Tiger Shot from this close,

09:51.720 --> 09:55.180
there's no way he'll be able to keep playing football, this time!

09:55.740 --> 09:58.270
It's too dangerous! Stop it, Tsubasa!

09:58.270 --> 09:59.940
Hyuga, please, don't shoot!

10:00.940 --> 10:01.690
What?!

10:01.690 --> 10:03.200
<i>He stopped himself!</i>

10:03.200 --> 10:05.320
<i>Hyuga won't shoot!</i>

10:05.320 --> 10:08.520
<i>Tsubasa, this is no act of mercy!</i>

10:08.520 --> 10:15.280
<i>The only reason I stopped was to ensure everyone's pass was a surefire goal!</i>

10:15.280 --> 10:17.790
<i>A calm decision from Hyuga!</i>

10:17.790 --> 10:19.790
<i>The Tiger Shot is fired once again!</i>

10:24.010 --> 10:24.710
<i>What?!</i>

10:24.710 --> 10:27.510
<i>Ishizaki was behind, jumped while being obscured by Tsubasa!</i>

10:27.510 --> 10:30.580
<i>Hyuga wasn't aware of it!</i>

10:30.580 --> 10:31.500
<i>Damn!</i>

10:31.500 --> 10:33.890
<i>With Tsubasa in the way, I couldn't see him...</i>

10:33.890 --> 10:36.560
It hurts...

10:36.560 --> 10:37.730
You did it!

10:37.730 --> 10:40.560
Nice Face Block, Ishizaki!

10:40.560 --> 10:44.060
It hurts dammit!

10:42.860 --> 10:44.060
Ishizaki...

10:46.790 --> 10:48.980
It's because you jumped in the way! Otherwise,

10:48.980 --> 10:50.570
there's no way I could've blocked it.

10:51.490 --> 10:55.500
That makes it a combination play between you and me, Tsubasa.

10:55.500 --> 10:56.530
Ishizaki...

10:56.530 --> 11:02.400
It loses to your Golden Duo with Misaki, but we can call it a duo between gold and a pebble.

11:02.400 --> 11:04.270
That's not true, Ishizaki.

11:04.270 --> 11:04.920
Huh?

11:04.920 --> 11:08.200
That play was the best golden duo play Nankatsu has.

11:08.200 --> 11:11.700
Well, when it's Tsubasa and Ishizaki, we should call it the uneven duo.

11:12.930 --> 11:15.480
All right, let's block this corner kick as well.

11:15.480 --> 11:17.770
Let's get out of this one together, as Nankatsu!

11:17.770 --> 11:18.430
Sure!

11:18.900 --> 11:19.990
Guys...

11:21.430 --> 11:22.920
Can you stand?

11:22.920 --> 11:23.790
Yeah.

11:26.270 --> 11:28.690
<i>Thank you, Ishizaki.</i>

11:29.330 --> 11:34.700
<i>You were the first friend I made when I moved to Nankatsu city, Ishizaki.</i>

11:35.490 --> 11:42.450
<i>One of the reasons I rejected Toho scouts' offer was because you stayed on Nankatsu MS, Ishizaki.</i>

11:43.110 --> 11:49.130
<i>The match will resume with Toho's corner kick; however, Hyuga is thoroughly marked.</i>

11:49.130 --> 11:50.420
Imai!

11:50.420 --> 11:52.130
Give it to me!

11:52.130 --> 11:53.330
Good.

11:54.090 --> 11:56.480
<i>The ball goes to Sawada!</i>

11:56.480 --> 11:57.990
<i>It was a short corner.</i>

11:57.990 --> 11:58.800
Here it goes!

11:59.390 --> 12:00.180
What?!

12:01.350 --> 12:02.020
<i>This is...</i>

12:02.020 --> 12:04.520
<i>The goalkeeper Wakashimazu is overlapping here!</i>

12:04.730 --> 12:07.850
<i>Even if I can't use my left arm, I can still shoot!</i>

12:07.850 --> 12:11.570
<i>I will pay everyone back for the burden I imposed on them on defense, with offense!</i>

12:11.570 --> 12:13.360
Take this, Nankatsu!

12:14.110 --> 12:15.200
Damn!

12:15.740 --> 12:18.070
<i>Takasugi blocks it however!</i>

12:19.490 --> 12:21.870
<i>The ball flies up high in front of the goal!</i>

12:21.870 --> 12:23.200
Why is it me, every time...?

12:23.200 --> 12:24.750
Good, it's mine!

12:24.750 --> 12:25.710
Leave it to me!

12:26.140 --> 12:28.500
<i>Izawa wins the aerial battle!</i>

12:30.640 --> 12:32.650
<i>Tsubasa clears the ball, sending it far away.</i>

12:32.650 --> 12:34.130
<i>Nankatsu escapes the crisis!</i>

12:34.130 --> 12:36.340
You did a great job, despite your battered body.

12:37.210 --> 12:38.010
This is!

12:39.020 --> 12:40.780
He didn't clear the ball.

12:40.780 --> 12:41.760
He made a shot.

12:41.760 --> 12:43.140
Crap!

12:43.140 --> 12:46.890
<i>Because their goalkeeper, Wakashimazu, was just participating on offense,</i>

12:46.890 --> 12:48.900
<i>Toho's goal was left wide open!</i>

12:50.770 --> 12:54.280
<i>The ball is steadily bouncing right up the middle to the goal!</i>

12:54.700 --> 12:57.150
I won't let anyone score on me!

13:05.630 --> 13:06.910
Take it!

13:08.150 --> 13:12.420
<i>If Tsubasa was his usual self, there's no way I would've caught up.</i>

13:15.380 --> 13:18.370
<i>Damn, it's impossible to give Hyuga the ball like this.</i>

13:18.370 --> 13:19.970
Don't mind me!

13:19.970 --> 13:24.660
The more they mark me, the more room they're giving you!

13:24.660 --> 13:26.610
I don't have to score the winning goal!

13:26.610 --> 13:28.980
Just think about winning, and nothing else!

13:28.980 --> 13:30.540
Hyuga.

13:30.540 --> 13:31.230
All right!

13:31.610 --> 13:32.730
Here I go!

13:35.530 --> 13:36.530
Tsubasa...

13:36.530 --> 13:37.780
Tsubasa.

13:37.780 --> 13:39.400
What's wrong with him, Misugi?

13:39.400 --> 13:42.070
Tsubasa hasn't moved an inch for a while.

13:43.200 --> 13:44.580
<i>It's no good.</i>

13:44.580 --> 13:47.030
<i>I can barely even stand now.</i>

13:47.030 --> 13:48.500
<i>My body...</i>

13:48.500 --> 13:50.670
<i>It won't move.</i>

13:50.670 --> 13:53.250
<i>Sorry, guys.</i>

13:53.250 --> 13:54.540
Coach!

13:55.440 --> 13:57.260
Dr. Kamijo!

13:57.260 --> 14:00.590
<i>Are Nankatsu preparing for a substitution in these final moments?</i>

14:01.590 --> 14:04.550
<i>Will they replace their captain, Tsubasa?</i>

14:05.220 --> 14:06.520
<i>What did you say?</i>

14:06.520 --> 14:08.100
<i>You say Tsubasa will be subbed?</i>

14:08.800 --> 14:10.570
<i>#10...</i>

14:10.570 --> 14:11.850
<i>I'm being substituted...</i>

14:12.550 --> 14:16.480
<i>Tsubasa, #10 is the ace's number in Brazil.</i>

14:16.480 --> 14:18.900
<i>It's a number that everyone is striving to be.</i>

14:20.060 --> 14:21.870
<i>Roberto...</i>

14:21.870 --> 14:23.510
<i>It can't be helped, though.</i>

14:23.510 --> 14:26.870
<i>I mean, my body won't move.</i>

14:27.300 --> 14:28.370
A chance there!

14:28.370 --> 14:31.680
<i>He takes advantage of a moment of distraction and passes it to Hyuga!</i>

14:31.680 --> 14:33.040
Crap!

14:33.990 --> 14:35.630
<i>There are 3 minutes left!</i>

14:35.630 --> 14:43.140
<i>A Tiger Shot for victory, for Toho's first championship, is about to get launched from Hyuga!</i>

14:43.140 --> 14:45.760
<i>Hyuga will shoot it.</i>

14:45.760 --> 14:48.400
<i>Nope, I can't move.</i>

14:48.400 --> 14:51.690
<i>I can't go there and stop it anymore.</i>

14:52.280 --> 14:53.410
<i>I'm going to lose.</i>

14:54.310 --> 14:55.690
<i>Am I going to lose?</i>

14:56.860 --> 14:58.440
<i>It will be over with this, though.</i>

14:59.050 --> 15:01.190
<i>I can be at ease finally.</i>

15:01.190 --> 15:04.080
<i>I'm sure everyone will understand.</i>

15:04.080 --> 15:06.300
<i>I did all I could.</i>

15:06.300 --> 15:08.960
<i>Even if I couldn't get the V3...</i>

15:08.960 --> 15:11.660
<i>There are other dreams to make real.</i>

15:11.660 --> 15:14.010
<i>I will go to Brazil and become a professional.</i>

15:14.010 --> 15:16.610
<i>Then I will make Japan number one in the world.</i>

15:16.610 --> 15:19.500
<i>Comparing to them, this tournament is so...</i>

15:21.010 --> 15:26.930
<i>But then... why did I fight until now, abusing my body in this way...?</i>

15:30.180 --> 15:31.520
Tsubasa!

15:33.520 --> 15:36.000
Is this really it for you?!

15:36.000 --> 15:38.270
Now's the time you run out of gas, Tsubasa?!

15:38.720 --> 15:39.900
Hyuga...

15:41.230 --> 15:42.820
Eat this!

15:44.040 --> 15:45.660
Tsubasa, watch out!

15:45.660 --> 15:46.320
Dodge it!

15:51.480 --> 15:54.660
<i>Tsubasa won't fall, despite that!</i>

15:55.710 --> 16:02.340
<i>Tsubasa, if it's really over for you, then I will put the nails in your coffin myself!</i>

16:02.340 --> 16:03.340
Eat this!

16:04.200 --> 16:05.100
What?!

16:05.100 --> 16:07.680
<i>He dodges acting a moment faster with a jump!</i>

16:07.680 --> 16:08.930
<i>Tsubasa is in the air!</i>

16:10.760 --> 16:12.770
Tsubasa is resurrected.

16:12.770 --> 16:14.270
It's impossible!

16:14.270 --> 16:16.270
Another miracle has occurred.

16:16.680 --> 16:20.240
<i>Despite taking a Tiger Shot straight on, it's like he's been resurrected!</i>

16:20.240 --> 16:21.780
<i>He is truly like a phoenix!</i>

16:21.780 --> 16:24.040
Good, follow Tsubasa's lead guys!

16:24.040 --> 16:24.860
Yeah!

16:25.820 --> 16:29.190
<i>Tsubasa, run until your strength runs dry,</i>

16:29.190 --> 16:32.020
<i>towards your dream, with every ounce of strength in you,</i>

16:32.020 --> 16:35.960
<i>until you reach the limit of that body... that flesh of yours!</i>

16:35.960 --> 16:37.520
<i>Run, oh, Tsubasa!</i>

16:37.520 --> 16:39.170
<i>Oh Tsubasa, run!</i>

16:39.170 --> 16:41.920
<i>Tsubasa wasn't dead yet.</i>

16:41.920 --> 16:44.340
It's our last battle, Tsubasa!

16:52.400 --> 16:53.810
Tsubasa!

16:56.860 --> 16:59.190
<i>Tsubasa's getting ready to shoot!</i>

16:59.190 --> 17:01.690
<i>But Hyuga manages to get around him!</i>

17:01.690 --> 17:03.530
<i>I won't let you score a goal!</i>

17:03.530 --> 17:05.940
<i>A one-on-one battle between Tsubasa and Hyuga.</i>

17:05.940 --> 17:09.530
<i>Should I miss the timing and send it back with a Drive Shot?</i>

17:09.530 --> 17:13.160
<i>I won't call it a victory until I win against you!</i>

17:13.160 --> 17:14.210
<i>He's right.</i>

17:14.210 --> 17:16.960
<i>It isn't a true victory if I run away now!</i>

17:18.360 --> 17:20.270
<i>They hit the ball at the same time!</i>

17:20.270 --> 17:22.250
<i>A clash between same strengths!</i>

17:23.250 --> 17:24.060
Tsubasa!

17:24.060 --> 17:24.750
Hyuga!

17:24.750 --> 17:27.220
<i>The ball hasn't even moved an inch!</i>

17:31.430 --> 17:36.020
Go, carry our dreams and paint the rainbow of victory!

17:37.020 --> 17:39.730
Drive Shot!

17:39.730 --> 17:43.770
<i>Tsubasa's Drive Shot takes flight off to azure blue sky!</i>

17:44.710 --> 17:45.920
<i>Lose...</i>

17:46.800 --> 17:48.860
<i>Am I going to lose again?!</i>

17:50.100 --> 17:51.070
I will stop it.

17:51.070 --> 17:52.700
I will do it for sure!

17:54.530 --> 17:56.580
Karate Chop Defense!

17:59.000 --> 18:00.880
<i>He blocks it!</i>

18:00.880 --> 18:04.340
<i>Wakashimazu repels the Drive Shot away, using its spin against it!.</i>

18:09.190 --> 18:10.090
Wakashimazu!

18:11.540 --> 18:13.540
<i>He got me…</i>

18:13.540 --> 18:16.180
<i>Well done, Wakashimazu…</i>

18:16.970 --> 18:17.950
Clear the ball!

18:17.950 --> 18:19.310
Keep attacking guys!

18:19.980 --> 18:21.480
<i>Toho clears it!</i>

18:22.020 --> 18:24.520
<i>The ball goes back to Tsubasa!</i>

18:25.240 --> 18:26.350
<i>The ball…</i>

18:26.350 --> 18:28.990
<i>My friend is coming back to me!</i>

18:28.990 --> 18:30.720
<i>I have to shoot!</i>

18:30.720 --> 18:31.940
Tsubasa!

18:32.740 --> 18:34.070
<i>I will shoot!</i>

18:34.910 --> 18:37.830
<i>Tsubasa’s going for his Drive Shot!</i>

18:40.860 --> 18:41.830
No!

18:41.830 --> 18:45.840
<i>I'll be able to score from here, with the help of your Drive Shot!</i>

18:46.550 --> 18:49.670
Tiger Shot!

18:49.670 --> 18:51.830
<i>Hyuga sends the shot right back!</i>

18:51.830 --> 18:52.930
Go!

18:52.930 --> 18:54.390
That’s definitely a shot!

18:54.390 --> 18:55.610
He is aiming to score!

18:55.610 --> 18:58.890
That's insane! The opponent's goal is almost 90 meters away!

19:00.060 --> 19:01.430
No way!

19:01.430 --> 19:05.440
Here is the last shot!

19:05.440 --> 19:09.150
<i>Tsubasa returns the shot with a high Jumping Volley!</i>

19:09.150 --> 19:10.110
What?!

19:10.110 --> 19:17.120
<i>The arcing rainbow of the repelled Tiger Shot and Drive Shot hurtles straight towards Toho's goal!</i>

19:22.680 --> 19:23.370
Ken!

19:25.380 --> 19:26.500
<i>I'll score!</i>

19:26.500 --> 19:32.340
<i>I have to stop it! I refuse to lose to Tsubasa and Nankatsu!</i>

19:33.360 --> 19:34.370
Hyuga!

19:34.370 --> 19:35.550
<i>He stopped it!</i>

19:35.550 --> 19:36.970
<i>Another save!</i>

19:36.970 --> 19:37.970
Kojiro!

19:37.970 --> 19:39.140
Captain!

19:39.140 --> 19:40.100
Hyuga!

19:40.100 --> 19:41.850
Wakashimazu!

19:42.620 --> 19:45.400
<i>Wakashimazu has stopped close to the line!</i>

19:45.400 --> 19:47.900
<i>Nankatsu has failed!</i>

19:48.820 --> 19:50.470
<i>He's so strong!</i>

19:50.470 --> 19:52.430
<i>That's Hyuga for you...</i>

19:53.320 --> 19:56.030
<i>The whistle signaling the end of the second half blows!</i>

19:56.030 --> 19:58.030
<i>Neither side manage to reach a conclusion!</i>

19:58.030 --> 20:00.540
<i>The match will continue with extra time.</i>

20:00.540 --> 20:02.990
Tsubasa!

20:02.990 --> 20:04.450
What's wrong, Tsubasa?!

20:04.450 --> 20:05.790
Are you okay?

20:07.000 --> 20:10.630
It's extra time now, right, guys?

20:11.800 --> 20:13.100
Tsubasa!

20:13.100 --> 20:16.970
Unfortunately I can't allow you to play.

20:16.970 --> 20:19.170
It's as the doctor says.

20:19.170 --> 20:21.810
You've done really well up to this point.

20:21.810 --> 20:26.230
Leave the rest to the others and focus on having your leg and shoulder treated.

20:26.230 --> 20:29.480
Doctor, I did not pass out.

20:30.350 --> 20:34.950
Just as I thought I was out of strength, Hyuga woke me up.

20:34.950 --> 20:39.530
My body hadn't hit its limit that time.

20:39.570 --> 20:45.080
I must fight, for Hyuga's sake, who let me know that.

20:45.080 --> 20:46.350
He is right!

20:46.350 --> 20:50.780
Do you think a player that is unable to play could make such shots one after another?

20:50.780 --> 20:54.780
You were supposed to take Tsubasa out of the game when he was unable to move.

20:54.780 --> 20:55.590
You boys...

20:56.050 --> 21:00.270
Let's aim for our dream V3 until the very end!

21:00.270 --> 21:01.100
Yeah.

21:10.020 --> 21:11.570
Manager...

21:11.570 --> 21:12.860
Tsubasa.

21:15.530 --> 21:20.620
Tsubasa, do your best from now on, in the extra time too.

21:24.870 --> 21:25.620
Here it is.

21:27.370 --> 21:28.910
Sure, thank you.

21:38.820 --> 21:40.050
Oh?

21:41.790 --> 21:43.820
What's wrong, Kumi?

21:43.820 --> 21:47.430
I don't know why, but... the tears just started coming.

21:47.430 --> 21:49.960
Couldn't even score once in the second half, huh?

21:49.960 --> 21:52.170
Still, it's been a good match so far.

21:52.170 --> 21:54.940
You defended really well at the end!

21:54.940 --> 21:58.380
Wakashimazu, I'll be counting on you for the extra time as well.

21:58.380 --> 21:59.700
Yes sir, count on me please!

21:59.700 --> 22:02.680
These 20 minutes of extra time will be the decisive battle!

22:02.680 --> 22:03.660
Yes sir!

22:03.660 --> 22:09.000
<i>The extra time, consisting of two 10-minute halves, will start in front of this huge audience!</i>

22:04.910 --> 22:06.660
SIGN: EXTRA TIME

22:09.880 --> 22:13.190
<i>The extra time will kick-off with Nankatsu's ball!</i>

22:38.730 --> 22:44.780
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.730 --> 22:44.780
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.780 --> 22:50.780
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.780 --> 22:50.780
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.780 --> 22:56.830
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.780 --> 22:56.830
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.830 --> 23:01.460
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.830 --> 23:01.460
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.090 --> 23:07.760
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.090 --> 23:07.760
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.090 --> 23:15.180
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.090 --> 23:15.180
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.180 --> 23:21.230
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.230 --> 23:25.690
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.230 --> 23:25.690
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:26.990 --> 23:33.330
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:26.990 --> 23:33.330
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.330 --> 23:39.370
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.370 --> 23:45.670
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.370 --> 23:45.670
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:50.060 --> 24:00.050
<b>COMING UP, EPISODE 51:
MIRACLE DRIVE SHOT!</b>
